# Example Co. — Senior Platform Engineer

**Status:** open, 2026-01-05 (drafting — not yet submitted)

This is placeholder example content shipped with resu-me so `just compile`, `just
check`, and `just review` all have something to run against out of the box. It's named
`opportunity.md.example`, not `opportunity.md` — the `.example` suffix is the repo's
convention for shipped scaffolding that isn't real data, so it can't be mistaken for a
live application (see AGENTS.md). `just get-started` offers to delete this whole
directory, and the matching `TODO.md` section, once `about_me.md`,
`career-timeline.md`, and `job-search.md` all exist for real.

## The role

- **Posting:** Senior Platform Engineer, via https://example.com/careers (fictional).
- **Comp:** $170–190k posted, fictional example range.
- **Location:** remote, US.
- **Referral:** none.

